# Topband BMS Simulator V2

V2 of the Topband BMS simulator. Hardware-in-the-loop test harness for the V3.0
gateway firmware: impersonates 1–16 packs over RS485, observes Victron CAN
output, generates fixtures for the V3.0 host test suite.

See `architecture.md` (gitignored, kept locally only) for design.
See `deploy/README.md` for Pi setup.

## Quickstart (dev laptop)

```sh
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
pytest -v
```

SIM-1 ships the framing layer, frame builders, and tests only. The RS485
listener, scenario engine, HTTP API, and CAN monitor land in later phases.
`python -m simulator` prints a placeholder until SIM-3.
